    },
    {
      "id": "1dbc870b-8132-48e3-ae7a-4cd9fce80808",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23,
      "y": 14,
      "width": 22,
      "height": 8,
      "text": "On top of finishing up yesterday's FSM, I also learned about a lot of new concepts:\n- Timing: Hold Time, Setup Time, Clock Skew, Contamination Delays, etc. (Pretty tricky stuff, I still don't have a perfect grasp on it)\n- Parallelism \n- Adders: Half Adders, Full Adders, CPA (Ripple Carry, Carry Lookahead, Prefix)",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "zIndex": -2
    },
